                        ],
                        "form": "die Affenmenschen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5c798d78-3e4c-36c2-8492-c49f10ece545",
                        "entry_id": "5a510f4f-cef9-3ae1-9496-83441d7a85f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "umgangssprachliche Bezeichnung für ausgestorbene Vertreter der Frühmenschen (Homini), im Umfeld des Australopithecus, die sowohl Merkmale moderner Menschen wie auch Merkmale der Menschenaffen aufweisen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anthropologie",
                            "Paläontologie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30695c39-613d-433b-84d4-7a548410a1f1",
                                "sense_id": "5c798d78-3e4c-36c2-8492-c49f10ece545",
                                "text": "Die früher als Java- oder Affenmensch (Pithecanthropus) bezeichneten Hominiden werden heute systematisch in den Formenkreis des Homo erectus gestellt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92aaa012-e280-4473-887e-7c6021420c82",
                                "sense_id": "5c798d78-3e4c-36c2-8492-c49f10ece545",
                                "text": "„Die von Ernst Haeckel postulierte Übergangsform zwischen den Menschenaffen und dem Menschen benannte dieser selbst mit ‚Pithecanthropus alalus‘, der noch nicht sprachbegabte Affenmensch.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d4968e2-509b-48b0-a6a1-7733edee88cd",
                                "sense_id": "5c798d78-3e4c-36c2-8492-c49f10ece545",
                                "text": "„Den hypothetischen Urmenschen nannte Haeckel ‚Homo primigenius oder Pithecanthropus primigenius‘, wobei er einen gleitenden Übergang von hypothetischen ‚Affenmenschen (Pithecanthropi)‘ zu sprachlosen ‚Urmenschen (Alali)‘ vermutete.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cea1621b-a070-4b1d-9363-b8e45bc8bda3",
                                "sense_id": "5c798d78-3e4c-36c2-8492-c49f10ece545",
                                "text": "„Rund zwanzig Individuen der Spezies Homo sapiens quieken erschreckt. Die Helden des Dramas, Exemplare des frühen Affenmenschen Australopithecus, sind vor etwa drei Millionen Jahren von der Weltbühne verschwunden. Und doch – sie bewegen sich: Roboter, in eine Tarnhaut aus Silikon und Menschenhaar gehüllt, übernehmen ihre Rolle in einem ‚einzigartigen Schauspiel zur Menschheitsgeschichte‘, zu dem der Kölner Zoo noch bis zum 20. Oktober lädt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e1b6242b-aa60-4fa1-ad9c-2dda8dead6a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a510f4f-cef9-3ae1-9496-83441d7a85f3",
                        "source_sense_id": "5c798d78-3e4c-36c2-8492-c49f10ece545",
                        "source_sense_description": "umgangssprachliche Bezeichnung für ausgestorbene Vertreter der Frühmenschen (Homini)",
                        "target_lang_word": "apeman",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "apeman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f34a9240-e7f4-3c3f-8c7f-2bac6184c1c0",
                                        "entry_id": "27ca71bf-3847-38f3-81b6-b8d89885830f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A prehistoric man resembling an ape, especially one held to be a precursor to modern humans; a non-human australopithecine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96da5e1e-9ed2-4264-bd28-e9b130665f5c",
                                                "sense_id": "f34a9240-e7f4-3c3f-8c7f-2bac6184c1c0",
                                                "text": "Only above the eyebrows, where the sloping forehead and low, curved skull of the ape-man were in sharp contrast to the broad brow and magnificent cranium of the European, could one see any marked difference."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7238981b-cf1a-351c-984d-13799ae68e40",
                                        "entry_id": "27ca71bf-3847-38f3-81b6-b8d89885830f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A human raised from childhood by apes (generally in reference to, or in imitation of, the fictional character Tarzan)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "638614f4-6620-4bbf-af4a-440a2a22d29c",
                                                "sense_id": "7238981b-cf1a-351c-984d-13799ae68e40",
                                                "text": "How may we judge him, by what standards, this ape-man with the heart and head and body of an English gentleman, and the training of a wild beast?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f35656fc-48b8-4c34-b066-7c7dd9b09e61",
                                                "sense_id": "7238981b-cf1a-351c-984d-13799ae68e40",
                                                "text": "Like countless other ape men, this Tarzan (who is voiced by Tony Goldwyn, but looks like a dreadlocked Calvin Klein model) is raised to feral hunkdom by a gorilla couple, Kala (Glenn Close) and Kerchak (Lance Henrikson), who disagree on the appropriateness of introducing human children to the brute society of American-accented apes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd8153b4-81cf-4d70-85fb-5d490addd646",
                                                "sense_id": "7238981b-cf1a-351c-984d-13799ae68e40",
                                                "text": "Human Nature has as its hero a caged ape man, and, like him, it has been hanging around for quite a while awaiting release."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48fd6277-aa78-45ab-9440-21c4b15d1979",
                                                "sense_id": "7238981b-cf1a-351c-984d-13799ae68e40",
                                                "text": "Apes leap to and fro, ape men swing from trees, and even a giant, menacing spider gets in on the act."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76bf78a4-3629-4957-bbf2-cea9729dc1c0",
                                                "sense_id": "7238981b-cf1a-351c-984d-13799ae68e40",
                                                "text": "Weissmuller introduced the Ape Man's famous victory cry, a recorded blend of a soprano's high C, a hyena howl played backwards, a camel's bleat, the twang of a violin string and an Olympic hero bellowing at the top of his voice. It was echoed in neighbourhoods from Cardiff to California, followed by the sound of snapping arms and legs as kids toppled from trees, casualty departments packed with failed young ape men."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96e54e9f-9e97-3de3-b54a-6416893aa4e3",
                                        "entry_id": "27ca71bf-3847-38f3-81b6-b8d89885830f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A reputed or legendary, large, bipedal, ape-like creature, as Bigfoot or the Yeti, or a primitive australopithecine still extant today."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
